HHIISSTTOORRYY
     This free YYPP subsystem is thought to be compatible with Sun's implementa‐
     tion.  It is, of course, not compatible with NNIISS++ or any other “secure”
     YYPP subsystem other than the native one.

     The name YYPP stands for Yellow Pee.

